null}],"topic_review_status":"preserved_accepted_topics","overall_review_status":"original_text_keep","source_url":"https://x.com/i/status/2092020127692923169"},"2105293151695151574":{"original_text":"tradingcultで出金拒否されました。\nスキャルピングとのことですが、チャレンジ時の時から予想と違った動きの場合はすぐに損切りしてますし利益を取る時は値幅もしっかり取ってます。ただの難癖つけて出金拒否するってトレーディングカルトさんはふざけてるのですか？\n@TradingCultJP \n@nordine_fx https://t.co/Ss2DHjNafm","original_text_sha256":"bac4d09f5a85f492c5af19f30b965fa7b32c89f0ccf48fc371d4197d32ab5e99","post_date_utc":"2026-09-30","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"payout","ui_topic":"payout","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_own_or_direct_observation"},{"topic":"rules_application","ui_topic":"rules","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_own_or_direct_observation"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"payout","ui_topic":"payout","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_own_or_direct_observation"},{"topic":"rules_application","ui_topic":"rules","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_own_or_direct_observation"}],"topic_review_status":"preserved_accepted_topics","overall_review_status":"original_text_keep","source_url":"https://x.com/i/status/2105293151695151574"},"1931844695371747489":{"original_text":"TradingCultに関する現時点の感想をひと言・・\n\nスプレッドが広い・・・日経も為替も金も銀も・・・\nただただ・・スプレッドがワイドだ・・。\n\nこれでも以前よりも狭くなったんですけどね。\n\nとにかくこのスプレッドの広さはステップ合格の大きな障害になるのは間違いないです。\n\n#TradingCult","original_text_sha256":"06a390f67eebe6fa7f973385d5dfd4f8f0ac2220b1c8c98fbd2d48fec366cbbe","post_date_utc":"2025-06-08","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"trading_cost","ui_topic":"fees","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"trading_cost","ui_topic":"fees","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"topic_review_status":"original_text_reviewed","overall_review_status":"original_text_keep","source_url":"https://x.com/i/status/1931844695371747489"},"1880937245877870795":{"original_text":"そしてこれが今現在のTradingCultのMT4\nもちろん仮想通貨しか動いてません。\n\n為替や金銀は取引時間外なのでスプレッドを見ても無意味。\nただ・・日経のスプレッドの狭さに目がとまった。\n\n仮想通貨も狭いですよね？\n私が大好きなBCHのスプが感動的💛\n\n#TradingCult https://t.co/mURvrtfcSy","original_text_sha256":"2d1da9a6580dbd8e0cc2125a668feb73c0b57c1705492ea46454a1c192fd8e74","post_date_utc":"2025-01-19","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"trading_cost","ui_topic":"fees","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"trading_cost","ui_topic":"fees","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"topic_review_status":"original_text_reviewed","overall_review_status":"original_text_keep","source_url":"https://x.com/i/status/1880937245877870795"},"2009996076787573031":{"original_text":"ここでTradingCultについて述べたい。\n\n昨夜の私はハードブリーチ食らった直後だったのでやや感情的になっていましたが、よく考えてみればルール違反したのは私なわけで・・・それを業者が悪いみたいに騒ぐのは良くないと思った。\n\nなので今回の件はきっぱりと水に流すことにしました。\n\n元々TradingCultは実直な業者さんなんです。\nだからこそ私はこれまで何度もチャレンジしてきたのです！\n\nTradingCultさんには私の言葉が過ぎた点を深くお詫びしたいと思います。\n\n#TradingCult","original_text_sha256":"3fe1033d7d1ee8ef281fffbae2c9062e68a40af9880f29cd8d59bb79078d3cfe","post_date_utc":"2026-01-10","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"general_assessment","ui_topic":"general","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"general_assessment","ui_topic":"general","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"topic_review_status":"original_text_reviewed","overall_review_status":"original_text_keep","source_url":"https://x.com/i/status/2009996076787573031"},"1969299158272995425":{"original_text":"TradingCultは　C-Trader　or MT4の二択です。私はMT4を選びました。\n\nまた、大きな特徴として日米の個別株を取扱っている点。\nただ・・前回使ってみた感じでは日本株CFDのスプレッドがトレード不能レベルでした。　\n今回改善されていると良いのですが・・\nここは月曜日に報告します。\n\n#TradingCult","original_text_sha256":"1731cc6b0fc49cad8e47cf3e7697faa9ee7641bcb330a3f6cca481bc5ebaab9c","post_date_utc":"2025-09-20","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"trading_cost","ui_topic":"fees","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"trading_cost","ui_topic":"fees","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"topic_review_status":"original_text_reviewed","overall_review_status":"original_text_keep","source_url":"https://x.com/i/status/1969299158272995425"},"1938784669836931284":{"original_text":"「言いがかり業者はネクストアカウント付与まで時間を要する」の原則\n\nTradingCultは、先月だったかな？　\n5Kの格安プランを購入してST①クリア！\n私がST②アカウント付与までの時間を計測していたことは言うまでもない　( • ̀ω•́ )\n\n案の定・遅いのなんの・・約半日かかったかな？\n\n#TradingCult","original_text_sha256":"dc2191c6a24e46cad569087e201ace80f15c4b441139ef7fbd984401a3d5b46a","post_date_utc":"2025-06-28","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"kyc_account","ui_topic":"rules","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"kyc_account","ui_topic":"rules","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"topic_review_status":"original_text_reviewed","overall_review_status":"original_text_keep","source_url":"https://x.com/i/status/1938784669836931284"},"1919326094202712485":{"original_text":"#TradingCult から、5,000$口座の割引のメールが届いて買っちゃいました\nクリプト払いしてみた👍\nお得な時に買って、ゆっくりチャレンジします😉","original_text_sha256":"867f07084106fb5fb48f1b6461a52589e3100ca85d24a85408fc090244dcc203","post_date_utc":"2025-05-05","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"purchase","ui_topic":"fees","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"purchase","ui_topic":"fees","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"topic_review_status":"original_text_reviewed","overall_r